WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.850
AwakeTab keeps your screen awake while you cook, read, or present.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.100
Choose a duration and press Keep awake.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.700
Wait for the browser to confirm Screen awake.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.200
Keep this tab visible, and press Stop when you are done.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.800
Free to use, with no account needed.
